[gd_resource type="Resource" format=3]

; Recipe — Stitch Thiar's Salve
; Tier-2 — a green-smelling rub-on salve named for Thiar the Stag.
; Use: applied before a fight, soaks into a cloth tunic, trims the first two cuts shallow.
; New-region ingredient: bark_tannin_oak harvested from a Whisperwood-fallen oak (post-apology).
; # NEEDS:item:thiar_salve (output — tier-2 salve, single-use buff consumable)
; # NEEDS:item:bark_tannin_oak, herb_starveil, beeswax_dab, clay_flask_empty (already flagged)

